        },
        "text": "=Return the analysis in JSON format with the following:\n\nAnalyze this Canva-generated image of gold jewellery. Based only on the visual content:\n\n1. Identify the type of jewellery (e.g., ring, bracelet, necklace).\n2. Briefly describe the design style (e.g., minimal, floral, modern, bold).\n3. Write a short, emotionally engaging caption (1–2 lines max).\n4. Generate 5 lowercase hashtags for jewellery lovers in the UAE. Include Arabic where visually fitting.\n\nAlways return a **valid JSON object with exactly these keys**\n\ntype: \"detected jewellery type\"\nstyle: \"visual style description\"\ncaption: \"caption\"\nhashtags:\n  - \"#uaejewellery\"\n  - \"#goldring\"\n  - \"#مجوهرات_دبي\"\n  - \"... up to 5\"\n\nDo NOT explain or add any other comments",
        "imageUrls": "={{$node[\"post image\"].json[\"secure_url\"]}}\n",
        "simplify": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -192,
        368
      ],
