        "text": "=You are analyzing a short-form jewellery reel (vertical MP4). \nBased only on the video:\n\n1. Identify the jewellery type featured (e.g., ring, bracelet, necklace, bangle).\n2. Describe the visual style and vibe (e.g., luxury minimal, bold glamour, traditional elegance).\n3. Summarize the overall mood in a few words (e.g., romantic, confident, festive).\n4. Write a very short, hook-style caption for Instagram/Facebook Reels and TikTok (max 1 sentence, an emojis).\n   - It should sound premium and stop scrolling.\n5. Generate 5 lowercase hashtags tailored for Reels visibility in the UAE jewellery market.\n   - Mix English + Arabic hashtags.\n   - Avoid spammy global ones (#love, #instagood).\n   - Prioritize discovery hashtags like #uaejewellery, #dubailuxury, #مجوهرات.\n\nAlways return a **valid JSON object with exactly these keys**\n\n\ntype: \"jewellery type\"\nstyle: \"style keywords\"\nmood: \"mood keywords\"\ncaption: \"1-sentence hook caption\"\nhashtags:\n  - \"#uaejewellery\"\n  - \"#dubailuxury\"\n  - \"#goldring\"\n  - \"#مجوهرات\"\n  - \"... up to 5\"",
        "videoUrls": "={{$node[\"post video\"].json[\"secure_url\"]}}",
        "simplify": false,
